      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样就明白她为何如此执着了——因为心中有梦想。\n为此，她不愿吝惜任何努力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0d26203185e0f1239bbc1f8818058b9f2df3223811842087b367dc74f70bb4d8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
