    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a298e99abcdb3dd5b31511",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟我亲眼所见，她在模拟赛中实在可惜。\n只要稍作改变，一定能大放异彩——对此我确信无疑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f35435162ddd71dbcc26b3424c3586b5bc3583d66682b9c38e33497d55004088",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
