    {
      "uid": "zhcn:35cf925d891431bb1e66d86b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……那个。其实两周后，有场特雷森学园参观会。\n是为了招待粉丝们而举办的活动……",
      "source_fingerprint": "1d183ad5407e23046ba53c85dc0e12d44c7afcca81b89a7404c2d803f9418756",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
