    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b955956a04d89e89e4bf9a92",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "赛跑史，有着深刻的戏剧性……而且，其中所编织的历史，\n所承载的故事，也不是那位马娘一人就能完结的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16179e23e1e9a3b8cd04c677cbf41e7e91e48d284bab6c6165c0c0cbac8a2a01",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        2,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/2/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:39f776211b23b749a211e135",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样啊，所以才……",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0e1b382284c6053b6616b604f256cdd092d7b473d150e57a9a72519dd107c45",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
