    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:de40b1e59e42727b000a7aa3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我到时候会参加这场活动。\n因此，我不想跑得太差……",
      "source_fingerprint": "31c8a566c647250f47090f7912c1cde3172a8644ae7ddc15fd627a08251b340d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        20,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/20/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da20f7a55d0479c87cf19b3e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以的话，也让我来帮忙吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae3507c24de96bf5c4c44b77182aabe3075852cafe0b26ee0ec1880ae5918af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6a56d2a4f177f6e85be72524",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可以的话，也让我来帮忙吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae3507c24de96bf5c4c44b77182aabe3075852cafe0b26ee0ec1880ae5918af",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
