      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/choice_data_list/1"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9e87fa58d01d3380119b93f8",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "……听了她诉说的梦想，感受到了她的热情。\n之后自然而然地，就说出了这样的话语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e250a3de935d5926603e1581b67811e24246c5dc4f5b0333141784f47a925a1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        21,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/21/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58b2226a78bb2b42971c9da3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "后来，拜托创世驹给我看了数场过往的比赛影像。\n……她在跑每一场比赛时都带着若有所思的表情。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7e63f3269731405a1f5c6fdb69d882311df65d31e541f87d907ac27c4687a7e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        22,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/22/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9b33bae33998987d22b20adf",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "内侧还有空间，不往里吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "146c4b68eb39014fc45c9ec2f176a6b9606f0cf70a860a032e38c76378fe6475",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
