    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e50f18303eb4c7a8efcd7c14",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但是，我还是选择了从外侧追赶。因为从过去的模拟赛\n来看，跑内侧的8号有斜行倾向。为了获胜所以——",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6da2397683d4e16884c1c2d55ffd4fce6c7c6f9b536ba98c77d8523bc452a19",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        25,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/25/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5677b46600e80ab41b1ff89a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "原来如此……",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d06f5a891ba2624277731a988574bb9f2f48b7bccc320f0c352e6f3e08904e8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/04/1133/storytimeline_041133003.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
