      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "结果，仅凭一句「别想太多，尽管去跑！」终究还是难以解决问题。\n既然如此，就该给出更行之有效的建议才是——",
      "source_fingerprint": "31bbcddf323906baee97df65b2909c4394ad7ea4a293a82f4b108afe5ca306f8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
