    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bfc27fb61bc95ce09893b56e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "历史是一幅“画卷”，是参与赛跑的所有人描绘的\n众多“点”连成线而浮现出来的……一幅巨大画卷。",
      "source_fingerprint": "25348373ef49d4604cb1d55bb7b50a71fb014983654bcd56d18619ba858b5a9e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
